(RB.COHERENTNOISE
  [LAMBDA (X)

         (* GIVEN A FLOAT X, RETURN A POINT ALONG NOISE PRIMTIVE.
         LARGER DELTAS BETWEEN X RESULT IN MORE NOISY NOISE)

    (LET* [(INT-X (FIX X))
